# Button and card spacing

A button, link styled as a button, or action row that sits against a card keeps at least 16px of space. The same 16px separates stacked cards.

- Put the space in shared CSS so one screen cannot drift.
- A save or action row inside a card keeps at least 16px above it, and the card padding keeps the button off the card edge.
- A back control is never flush with the card under it.
